CONTEXT OtelTracing IN ENGLISH

PURPOSE CONTEXT OtelTracing
{+ Minimal model for the OpenTelemetry regression spec (issue #440). It only needs
   an interface (to have API routes) and an invariant rule (to have a conjunct that
   the trace can show being evaluated). +}

RELATION personName[Person*Name] [UNI]
REPRESENT Name TYPE ALPHANUMERIC
RELATION worksFor[Person*Organization]

RULE PersonHasName : I[Person] |- personName;personName~
MEANING "Every person has a name"

INTERFACE Persons : V[SESSION*Person] cRud BOX
  [ "Name" : personName cRUd
  , "Works for" : worksFor cRUd
  ]

ENDCONTEXT
